      },
      "message": "Editorial updates\n\n* Use term “requester” to align with RISC-V IOMMU specification.\n* Merge attributes R and W1C to RW1C.\n* Add a figure to visualize the relations between RRID and IOPMP entries.\n* Clarify MDCFGLCK.f and ENTRYLCK.f can exceed HWCFG0.md_num and HWCFG1.entry_num.\n* Refine Chapter 1 introduction.\n* Fix typos and inconsistencies.",
